SY_TALK("g5CfaNpdWrU",[[203,["In Sahaja Yoga the Guru puja has a very","different significance"]],[214,["from any other guru puja."]],[223,["When you worship your Guru"]],[228,["you are also worshipping the Guru within","you."]],[240,["This is not in any other guru-disciple","system"]],[250,["because, in you, the Guru, the Master has","been awakened."]],[262,["And so, when you are worshipping your Guru,"]],[267,["then this Master within you is also","worshipped, you respect it,"]],[274,["you glorify it, you awaken it, and you","manifest it."]],[281,["This we have to realise that – in Sahaja","Yoga – if you are a Sahaja Yogi."]],[292,["Now, the quality of Guru, first and","foremost, is that he makes you meet God:"]],[303,["means he raises the Kundalini"]],[307,["and establish the relation between","the All-pervading Power."]],[317,["And as your Guru is Adi Shakti,"]],[319,["you make that person meet, also,","the Adi Shakti."]],[324,["So you have a double advantage that,","at the same time,"]],[330,["when you give them Realisation,"]],[333,["not only that you make them feel the union","with the Divine Power,"]],[340,["but you can make them meet the Divinity","Itself,"]],[345,["the source of Divine Power."]],[348,["So your responsibility, as Sahaja Yogis,","is very great"]],[354,["because in you is there is the Guru."]],[358,["Now in our mantras we say that, “Mother,","I am my own Guru.”"]],[366,["But, saying that, do we realise that:","if I am my own Guru,"]],[373,["this “I” and “my Guru,” between the two,","what have I achieved?"]],[381,["Where am I? Can I guide myself?"]],[387,["Have I got the light of the Spirit on my","attention so well established"]],[391,["and manifested that I can guide myself and","guide others later on?"]],[399,["First of all, in the Guru principle it is","important"]],[405,["that you see to yourself –","the introspection:"]],[410,["Can I be my own Guru? Have I become","my own Guru?"]],[419,["Now, in your case, your Guru is a Mother,","a woman,"]],[427,["so, it has to be among women that","the development of their Guru qualities"]],[439,["have to be very well manifested. But it’s","just the way it is not."]],[446,["For them, they are still the mothers or","they are the wives"]],[450,["or they are Sahaja Yoginis. But they don’t","realise that you are also the Gurus."]],[459,["And, because your Mother is a Guru,","because She is a woman;"]],[463,["and you have to be also of that quality,","that people should say,"]],[469,["“Look at this woman, she’s such a Guru.”"]],[472,["But still, as I hear from the different","leaders"]],[476,["that the ladies are absolutely still very","much far away"]],[480,["and are very few who can be called as real","Sahaja Yoginis."]],[486,["It’s a sad thing to hear."]],[490,["Because if you still keep to all these","mundane things of womanhood"]],[498,["and the drawbacks of womanhood, which has","come out of domination maybe,"]],[503,["because of always they were shown to be","something lower."]],[508,["Specially in the Christian religion they","were never regarded as something holy."]],[515,["They have this kind of a diffidence in them"]],[519,["that they don’t understand that dharma"]],[523,["can be established more by women than","by men."]],[527,["And the Guru’s work is to establish","the dharma –"]],[531,["in the society, in the family, in","relationships."]],[537,["All these Gurus, which are representing","all these great symbols here,"]],[543,["have done nothing but have established","dharma."]],[547,["But, first of all, before establishing","the dharma,"]],[550,["we should watch ourselves – have we got","dharma within ourselves or not?"]],[558,["First of all, the quality of a person who","has dharma"]],[564,["is that he listens to others, he obeys."]],[574,["And this is something [that] has gone wrong","with the Western women, I think,"]],[578,["that they have forgotten how to listen to","others, how to obey others."]],[583,["That’s why their children also don’t obey","them."]],[590,["Obedience, if you do not have, nobody’s","going to obey you."]],[595,["First, you must learn to obey."]],[599,["A person like Kabira, because he was born","of a unknown cast,"]],[608,["people didn’t know what he was born from,"]],[612,["and he could not go directly to any Guru."]],[619,["So, he heard about Ramanand, a great Guru","of those days,"]],[626,["who used to go to the river Ganges every","morning to have his bath."]],[631,["So one day on his steps Kabira kept lying,"]],[637,["and in the darkness the Guru could not see,","and he touched him with his feet."]],[644,["He said, “Who are you?” So he said,","“I’m Kabir,"]],[648,["and I’m your disciple.” And he caught hold","of his feet."]],[654,["And when he caught hold of his feet, he","[Ramanand] said, “Alright, come along!”."]],[657,["And then he became such a great saint","in India."]],[665,["People know him more than they know his","Guru; he became so great."]],[669,["The basic thing is humility."]],[671,["Yesterday you saw how the musician","(Nishat Khan) was humble."]],[675,["All the time he was humble."]],[678,["He didn’t know how to express his humility","every time."]],[682,["All the time he was humble."]],[685,["Because in humility only you can receive","the blessings,"]],[691,["you can receive the quality that is of your","Guru."]],[699,["Now, for a Guru as you have seen"]],[702,["that, in My own way, in My own image,","you have to come up."]],[709,["First of all your life should be absolutely","transparent."]],[713,["Transparency is the essence of Sahaja Yoga."]],[716,["Everybody should know what you are doing,","where you are going,"]],[719,["what is the way you live, what is the way","you are behaving."]],[726,["I have seen people, who are gurus, also","in the sense that we call them leaders,"]],[732,["or we can call them sub-gurus, or they","cannot be called as priest,"]],[735,["but I can say ‘communication centres’","as they are."]],[739,["In them you find that they are very fussy","type of people."]],[747,["Always think about their body, always think","about their comfort,"]],[751,["always grudge about – nobody looked after","them –"]],[755,["as if they suffer from persecution-mania!"]],[760,["Or they will grudge about food, “I didn’t","eat my food for one day!”"]],[764,["Doesn’t matter!"]],[766,["For a Guru it’s better to starve for about","three, four days nicely,"]],[770,["so that you get over this idea of hunger."]],[775,["You’ll be surprised since I’m here I have","not eaten anything much,"]],[779,["and just drinking something, because just","the Guru has no hunger."]],[784,["Because it is in your stomach the Guru,","vibrations, are so much"]],[789,["that you don’t feel like eating anything."]],[792,["So then, what do you eat and how do you","eat and all these things"]],[796,["that we have given up to come to Sahaja","Yoga."]],[798,["So even if leaders have this nonsense","in their head"]],[802,["[like] what do you get to eat! I mean, this","is the basics, absolutely!"]],[807,["And when I hear some people telling Me, oh,","what did they eat"]],[811,["and how did they eat and all! It’s like I","feel they are like tourists in Sahaja Yoga."]],[818,["Just come in Sahaja Yoga like tourists,"]],[821,["you see, to see places and go round"]],[824,["and to know where you get, in what","restaurant, you get good food and cheaply."]],[832,["All this is so basically,"]],[836,["absolutely not a manifestation of Guru","principle."]],[842,["Now you have seen your Guru as She is."]],[847,["I do not know what I eat, what they give","Me, what I want."]],[853,["They go on giving Me whatever they think","I like,"]],[856,["and I just don’t know if I like that thing","or not, or what is it."]],[861,["If they ask Me, “Mother, what will You","have?” I said, “What will I have,"]],[863,["I don’t know really, what will I have?","Anything!”"]],[867,["So there has to be no choices."]],[869,["First of all not to waste your attention","on choices."]],[873,["Of course, only on vibrations."]],[876,["I mean, supposing, you go to a restaurant,"]],[879,["find all kinds of funny vibrations there,"]],[882,["people are getting drunk or anything, then","of course you should say."]],[886,["But all the choices must be based on","vibrations and not on material things."]],[891,["That you get something nice there,","“Let’s go there,”"]],[893,["and they’ll travel for fifty miles to go","eat something nonsensical."]],[899,["It should be all nonsense for all Sahaja","Yogis."]],[903,["And when I said “Sahaja Yogi” it means","also Sahaja Yoginis."]],[907,["So the food part of it is aswadha."]],[911,["You should not have any taste for any","special food."]],[915,["Specially in France to say that people","may not like,"]],[917,["but French are very, very conscientious or","aware about the food part."]],[926,["I don’t know how far they make really","good food,"]],[930,["but at least they think they eat very good","food. Alright."]],[934,["So, the eating of good food is a kind","of an addiction."]],[941,["It’s a kind of an addiction; it’s something","like drug –"]],[944,["that you must have good food."]],[947,["So Zen started this system of what they","call the tea ceremony."]],[953,["In the tea ceremony what they did, I mean,","I have been through that"]],[958,["and it’s really quite a test of people."]],[963,["With Me it was alright, but the rest","of them got really frightened."]],[967,["That in the tea ceremony whatever rituals","they do"]],[970,["they give you a tea, which is so bitter,"]],[975,["and we can say [like] quinine raised","to power 108!"]],[977,["It’s like that. And they give you very","nicely,"]],[980,["handle you with such ritual that you have","to take it."]],[985,["So first they say, “You see the cup without","thinking.”"]],[991,["So he tried to make thoughtless awareness","through the cup."]],[994,["I don’t know how much one can achieve","with that."]],[997,["But that tea if you take once, your tongue","is good for anything."]],[1008,["And to compensate it they give you","something sweet,"]],[1013,["which is again sweetness raised to power","108,"]],[1016,["so sweet that it becomes bitter! So sweet."]],[1021,["So this is just to conquer the tongue","[that] Zen must have thought"]],[1026,["that better give them this tea ceremony"]],[1031,["where there is no tea, there’s nothing"]],[1034,["but just you really give such shocks","to your tongue,"]],[1039,["so that after that you can eat whatever","you get."]],[1044,["And that’s why you must know that Japanese","can eat anything."]],[1050,["They have solved their food problem","because they can eat anything!"]],[1055,["They can just fish out some crabs or could","be some prawns,"]],[1064,["just peel them out like peanuts and eat","them like that."]],[1068,["I think Zen has solved this problem","for them,"]],[1070,["because they have food shortage and this is","how they can eat everything:"]],[1074,["they can eat the bark of the tree, they can","eat the snake,"]],[1077,["they can eat the lizards, they can eat","the frogs, everything they can eat."]],[1081,["So all their eating problems are solved","in that country by Zen, I think,"]],[1087,["because you have no taste."]],[1093,["But in this I think the worst are,","in the whole world are Indians."]],[1098,["They are the fussiest people for food.","Because their women have spoiled them."]],[1103,["They know very good cooking and they know"]],[1105,["how to handle their husbands by cooking","very well."]],[1108,["And the way they cook food for them,","you see,"]],[1111,["the men have to go back to Indian food."]],[1113,["Even if they travel the whole world,","they’ll need Indian food,"]],[1117,["they can’t get over their tongues."]],[1119,["It is such a big conditioning in India","of food"]],[1123,["that I just don’t know how will they get","out,"]],[1125,["the, absolutely, the basics which are","important."]],[1130,["Gandhiji tried that very much in","the ashram."]],[1133,["He used to give horrid food, boiled food","with the oil of mustard on top"]],[1140,["and then nobody could eat that. Raw!"]],[1144,["And he used to make everybody eat that."]],[1146,["Not only that, he would make them clean","the bathrooms, WC’s, everything"]],[1152,["so that you get rid of your nose also, that","you need everything."]],[1156,["Because so many people you will, while","eating also in India"]],[1159,["will put something to their noses, and they","smell everything."]],[1162,["So they are oversensitive to their tongue","and to their nose."]],[1166,["But not to their eyes, to eyes they are","not."]],[1169,["For eyes I would say the most sensitive","people are Japanese and Chinese"]],[1175,["and also the Western people are very much","sensitive"]],[1177,["because they don’t like to see anything","dirty, filthy or ugly."]],[1181,["Indians won’t mind any dirt, filth,","anything,"]],[1184,["just like dogs and what you call, horses","or buffalos!"]],[1191,["They can walk through any dirt, filth –","anything!"]],[1195,["Nothing matters to them, anything ugly,","any ugly building"]],[1198,["or an ugly dress or anything is alright","for them."]],[1202,["It doesn’t matter, to their eyes it doesn’t","matter at all."]],[1205,["Only thing [is that] kitchen should be clean","and they are all the time in the kitchen."]],[1209,["So we don’t have to learn all these bad","things from Indians."]],[1212,["There are some good things they have, but","there are certain things"]],[1215,["[which] are very bad conditionings."]],[1217,["And the next to that are, I think,","the French."]],[1220,["But if you eat English food you can become","quite good"]],[1223,["because there’s no taste in English food."]],[1239,["So, I have no problem anywhere because","I think I have no taste at all"]],[1244,["and I can eat anything any way it is","cooked, it’s alright,"]],[1247,["I don’t bother about what is cooked, what","is not cooked."]],[1252,["But if you have some French people for","a dinner in a restaurant"]],[1256,["they will spend forty-five minutes deciding","what they are going to eat,"]],[1259,["and what a waste of energy!"]],[1261,["Forty-five minutes just to decide what they","are going to eat!"]],[1264,["After all what is so great, what you are","going to eat? It’s all there."]],[1267,["Just one thing that everybody should have."]],[1270,["So for Sahaja Yogis it’s important to give","up this idea, “I will have this.”"]],[1274,["First of all nobody should ask, “What will","you have?”"]],[1280,["To Me also. I do not like people asking Me","questions [like], “What will You have?”"]],[1286,["Because I’ve to think about it and I want","to be in Nirvichara."]],[1307,["So, this is a, one, big ordeal, which we do","not understand:"]],[1315,["how much we are attached to food. And food","goes in the stomach."]],[1320,["And not only that it spoils our guru","system,"]],[1323,["but also spoils our physical system."]],[1326,["So we should try not to look at food."]],[1329,["That’s why fasting was told to the all","the people"]],[1333,["who wanted to develop their Gurupada,","so that they should not fast."]],[1339,["But they do not fast normally because","they think of food, so there’s no fasting."]],[1347,["I mean, fasting means that you go into","Nirvichara and don’t think of food."]],[1351,["But they are all the time thinking of food,","so it has no meaning"]],[1355,["and you are just the same whether you eat it","or not, your mind is eating it all the time."]],[1360,["Then you start thinking, “When will I end","my fast"]],[1363,["and know where will I go to have what?”"]],[1369,["So this is a very basic thing that we","should get rid"]],[1372,["of our habits, of our conditionings –"]],[1375,["what we are going to have and what food","we are going to have."]],[1378,["Our children also should be given a proper","training about it that –"]],[1385,["it’s alright, sometimes there is no salt,","sometimes there’s no sugar, doesn’t matter."]],[1389,["And sometimes there’s nothing, doesn’t","matter."]],[1391,["Nothing [is] important for a Sahaja Yogi,"]],[1393,["you can live without food for days","together, no problem."]],[1401,["So for a Sahaja Yogi there’s nothing like","taste of food and hunger."]],[1408,["There’s only one hunger is to be purified,","to be clean."]],[1414,["This is one of the things that dirties","our mind, we should say,"]],[1419,["that we think about food all the time."]],[1426,["Even in Russia I found people carried","all Indian things there,"]],[1430,["they were cooking all Indian things, and","I am, poor thing, I can’t eat anything."]],[1434,["So they cooked, brought everything for Me,","thinking I’m an Indian,"]],[1437,["but they don’t know I am Zen – I cannot,","I do not, have sense of taste."]],[1442,["So once, to get over taste one has to work","out."]],[1447,["It’s an experiment we have to do with","ourselves."]],[1450,["Unless and until we introspect ourselves","and do experiments we cannot rise."]],[1456,["Because though the Kundalini is trying","her level best,"]],[1459,["but your conditionings are so great"]],[1461,["that it cannot pierce through and cannot","make you onto that Guru level."]],[1467,["If you see the lives of all these Gurus:","they were married,"]],[1471,["they had children, they lived a normal life"]],[1474,["but in their own personal life they were","absolutely detached people."]],[1481,["So, first detachment should come from food."]],[1486,["And there whatever you like you just","don’t eat."]],[1491,["That’s the best way. Because already","because of liking something…"]],[1494,["supposing if somebody’s fond of ice-cream."]],[1496,["He must have already spoiled his liver;","so then, give [it] up now."]],[1501,["If you like pasta, give up pasta."]],[1504,["If you like something else, just give up,"]],[1506,["don’t ask for it and don’t eat it at all;"]],[1509,["so that, you see, your mind will get little","bit detached from it."]],[1515,["It’s very easy to achieve this detachment,","I think,"]],[1520,["if you work it out in a sensible way. Just","try to punish your body."]],[1526,["You see, if you are your Guru, you better","take hold"]],[1529,["of first of all your body and your","conditionings."]],[1532,["You have to treat your body with this","thing."]],[1535,["I am told many girls who have married","abroad"]],[1538,["are still making their Indian food and","eating that."]],[1540,["It’s horrible it is! They should starve."]],[1543,["If they starve for say about five, six days","or maybe eight days,"]],[1547,["then they’ll eat any food in any case."]],[1550,["That’s why the fasting is given."]],[1552,["So one should adjust oneself to any kind","of food you can have."]],[1557,["And if you want to survive then you eat","anything,"]],[1561,["so just make it a point that you get rid"]],[1563,["of this very simple conditioning you have –"]],[1567,["of liking the food that you want to eat and","you don’t want to have anything else."]],[1573,["I think as Sahaja Yogini or Sahaja Yogi who","cannot get rid of this little thing,"]],[1578,["then how can you call him a Sahaja Yogi?","I don’t know. He’s very asahaj."]],[1582,["Because the other day I met one lady."]],[1585,["I said, “What is the matter, where have","you been?”"]],[1586,["She said, “I have been looking out for some","sort of an Indian ingredient.”"]],[1590,["I said, “How can you get it here in this","Spain? You cannot.” “Why?”"]],[1594,["“Because they asked me to make Indian","food.” “Alright."]],[1597,["Then without that can’t you make Indian","food?"]],[1599,["What is the need to run all the way, whole","day"]],[1602,["for a one small little thing called hing","(asafoetida)?”."]],[1604,["There’s a big name for that, it’s a small","little thing."]],[1607,["Just to get that she had to run all over","the places to get it!"]],[1611,["So for people who are Sahaja Yogis if they","are sahaj,"]],[1615,["whatever is available you can make","something nice out of it and eat it."]],[1623,["So that shows what? It shows sagacity,"]],[1627,["shows trupti (contentment), shows your","satisfaction."]],[1631,["And that is one of the manifestations","of a Guru"]],[1635,["that he’s a satisfied soul."]],[1638,["He’s just self-contained, he doesn’t","bother."]],[1642,["Now, for example, some people, specially","in the West,"]],[1646,["thank God, they are not spoiled by their","wives so much."]],[1648,["They don’t have so much of conditioning,","they can eat anything."]],[1651,["I’ve seen that when they come on the India","tour,"]],[1655,["all the Indians say, “Horrid food was given"]],[1657,["and the poor things were eating that horrid","food and this and that.”"]],[1662,["And I asked them, “Which place you like","the best?”"]],[1665,["They said, “Brahmapuri.” I said, “Eh? They","were saying"]],[1667,["Brahmapuri had the worst food and everybody","is complaining.”"]],[1670,["“No, no. Brahmapuri was the best,"]],[1672,["because we could bathe in the river and we","could sing"]],[1675,["and we could enjoy it!” You see, that’s","the sign of one thing,"]],[1679,["to get rid of your bad habits of food","business."]],[1685,["Now the second part is for the body you","need comforts."]],[1691,["I must congratulate the Western Sahaja","Yogis"]],[1695,["that they may be coming from any walk","of life –"]],[1700,["I must say, the Indians have to learn","from them –"]],[1703,["they may be coming from any position","or status."]],[1707,["All of them enjoy the comfort of the Spirit","when they travel in the Tour."]],[1714,["They do not ask for, “I haven’t got","a chair,"]],[1717,["I haven’t got a bed, I haven’t got a proper","things here.”"]],[1722,["In this way, you see, you will realise"]],[1725,["that the body comfort is of no importance."]],[1730,["It’s, we have just spoilt our body, there’s","no need, no need."]],[1734,["Body you put it anywhere, will sleep","in any case."]],[1736,["If you cannot sleep for two nights,"]],[1739,["alright, put on some music for one night","or two nights"]],[1742,["as we had here, you will sleep anyway!"]],[1757,["So this is the second point is that we have","to give up body comfort."]],[1767,["But the third point where I think","the Western people falter"]],[1771,["is their materialistic attitude.","Materialistic attitude"]],[1776,["and their fondness of their eyes. So one","of them is the worst of all."]],[1784,["I mean, the worst in worst of all is that","you can never have,"]],[1787,["that’s such a big blot if you have that,"]],[1790,["is to have a roving eye and things like","that."]],[1794,["It’s out of question. That’s out of","question for women or for men."]],[1798,["They are not Sahaja Yogis by any chance."]],[1801,["They have to have very clean eyes."]],[1806,["That part is alright."]],[1809,["And the second part is the greed, lust","and greed."]],[1813,["Of course, with Sahaja Yoga maybe the lust","part is over,"]],[1818,["but greed is still there with so many who","get lost."]],[1825,["So I would say Indians do not have this","lust problem,"]],[1828,["but they still have greed, greed problem –","means they want to buy something"]],[1834,["like a radio or some electrical stuff they","must buy."]],[1839,["If they come abroad they must buy","something."]],[1842,["It’s alright, if you get it, well and good,","if they don’t get it, well and good."]],[1845,["It should be [that attitude]. But for","a Westerner, you see,"]],[1848,["he would not like to give up his furniture,","which his great grandmother had it."]],[1854,["Though he can’t sit on it because it’s so","old."]],[1856,["If he sits on it, it will break. But he","must keep it to show off that,"]],[1860,["“I had a great grandmother who gave this","unique chair.”"]],[1864,["According to Indian standards it’s junk!","Absolute junk."]],[1869,["Because it is good for nothing you put it","in the drawing room,"]],[1872,["nobody can sit on it and it looks junky."]],[1875,["But according to the Western mind the older","it is, the better –"]],[1878,["whether it is a junk or anything – he’ll","have so many junks in the house"]],[1882,["and then they will sell like hot cakes."]],[1884,["Because there’s a very subtle materialistic","attitude"]],[1887,["towards matter that, “This will sell like","hot cakes if I sell it”,"]],[1891,["because there must be another mad Westerner","who would like to buy that junk. You see?"]],[1896,["So this junk that you have in the house","it’s better to get rid of,"]],[1900,["because God knows how many people must","have used [it]."]],[1904,["It’s like a grave in the house. It’s","a grave."]],[1907,["So to have then also the antique jewellery."]],[1910,["Antique jewellery is another mad, antique","is a – what you can say –"]],[1917,["is the fad or addiction of the Western","people – antique."]],[1922,["For us nothing is antique because we still","produce antique things, beautiful things"]],[1927,["so Indians don’t understand the value","of antiques."]],[1929,["They don’t understand how these people","are so mad"]],[1932,["after torn things and broken things and","dirty things and filthy things!"]],[1937,["But the Western mind has been brought up","that way."]],[1941,["Now, in these antique things I have seen","that,"]],[1943,["once I went to somebody’s house, you see,"]],[1945,["and he asked Me with very great honour","to sit on his chair."]],[1949,["And as soon as I sat on the chair I thought","there were snakes"]],[1952,["and there were scorpions all biting Me."]],[1955,["I got a fright, I got up. I said, “What","is it?”"]],[1957,["He said, “This is from great, great,","great grandmother, you see,"]],[1960,["she gave us this thing.” I said, “It will","break, I’d better sit outside.”"]],[1966,["So this also madness of this antique","is so much"]],[1970,["that it is unbelievable how people go","into it."]],[1976,["So there’s a joke in India there’s a very","great writer"]],[1981,["called as Premchand, he wrote about two","Englishmen"]],[1985,["going on the road of Benares when they were","hit by a lota (metal pot),"]],[1992,["that they use for their bathrooms, fell","on their feet. And it fell on their feet."]],[1999,["And jokingly he says, “on the feet where","all the bureaucrats fall.”"]],[2004,["Means, all Indian bureaucrats used to fall","at the feet of the English at that time!"]],[2008,["So he made a joke. But doesn’t matter."]],[2010,["Then the English, you see, looked at that","thing"]],[2012,["and they were very angry and immediately","they took to law,"]],[2015,["“You have to come to the courts, you have","to come to the police"]],[2018,["and we’re going to report this has fallen","there, it has hit us,” and all that."]],[2023,["So there was a clever man, he knew","the English or the Western mind,"]],[2028,["he said, “Sir, do you know this, this lota","has very valuable!” He said, “Why?”"]],[2034,["“Because this one was used by Akbar","the Great. So ancient it is”."]],[2039,["He said, “Really?” “Yes it is and, you","know, you just don’t quarrel with them."]],[2044,["And ask them for this lota.” And he told","in Indian language to them that,"]],[2048,["“I have befooled these people, I have told","them that this lota belonged to Akbar"]],[2054,["and you have to take this lota and use this","lota to just to befool them.”"]],[2063,["So then they asked, “But alright, we’ll","forgive you,"]],[2066,["we’ll not take you to any courts or","anything, but you just give us this lota.”"]],[2072,["They said, “No, we can’t.” He said, “Why?”"]],[2074,["“Because it’s such an antique piece,","you see.”"]],[2076,["In India you won’t find anybody respecting","antique pieces,"]],[2079,["especially in Benares nobody bothers."]],[2082,["So they said, “Really?”, “Yes, it belonged","to Akbar"]],[2085,["and, you know, my father was, my","forefathers worked with him,"]],[2089,["so he gave us this lota, we can’t give you,","we are sorry, you see.”"]],[2092,["“No, no, no, no, please give us, you see,","and we’ll no take you to the police.”"]],[2095,["“Alright, you charge us, whatever money","you charge us,” and all that."]],[2098,["In those days they paid one thousand","rupees, you see,"]],[2101,["this is equal to, now, one crore","(10 million), I think."]],[2103,["They gave, these English paid them and","bought that lota,"]],[2107,["which had nothing to do with Akbar or","anyone."]],[2111,["So this madness of antique has to go away","from our minds."]],[2115,["It’s such a built-in thing within us, that","we always talk of antiquities."]],[2122,["Perhaps maybe because of wars everything","was destroyed"]],[2125,["and whatever was in the olden times was","something very beautiful and good"]],[2129,["and now we are not making very good","things, perhaps, maybe that is the reason."]],[2133,["But now we are making nice things, we can","make."]],[2136,["Now in England I was surprised the old","crafts are coming up,"]],[2139,["everywhere I go the old crafts are coming","up."]],[2142,["So to respect antiques means you just","stop making the old craft revive."]],[2149,["Because you pay so much to the antiques,"]],[2151,["the same thing made today won’t fetch","the same price as it was."]],[2155,["Now this has ruined our creativity,"]],[2159,["ruined our handwork and it has ruined our","whole – I think the quality of our life,"]],[2165,["because the way we are mad after antiques."]],[2169,["So this also should go from your head that","anything antique is something good."]],[2176,["It’s a very superficial value – if you see","to it."]],[2180,["Because people think that antique is","something expensive."]],[2183,["It’s just a marketing style that people","have felt"]],[2187,["that this is expensive, that is expensive,","so it’s something great"]],[2190,["to wear something stupid and to say that,","“this is antique jewellery,” and go about."]],[2198,["I mean, God knows how many people must","have used it and must have worn it"]],[2201,["and what must be the feelings of that","person."]],[2204,["So we have to understand that this","conditioning that we have in our heads,"]],[2210,["that we must have something antiques with","us, keep something of such value."]],[2219,["I mean, these questions never arose before,","so it’s not written in any books."]],[2223,["Anyone of the books of the Gurus is not","written that, “Don’t care for antiques.”"]],[2228,["They have written, “Don’t drink, don’t","smoke,”"]],[2232,["all other things which spoils your Nabhi."]],[2235,["They’ve written all these things. But they","have not written"]],[2238,["that, “Don’t worry about antiques so much.”"]],[2241,["You see, and I find that’s a craze nowadays"]],[2244,["and so we have to tell people that we have","to be careful."]],[2248,["Moreover I feel the way people have gone","to drugs and that,"]],[2251,["maybe that because they used so much","antiques"]],[2253,["that the bhoots from the antiques must","have caught them."]],[2256,["Can’t understand that why people are","so melancholy,"]],[2259,["all the time crying, weeping, and all that."]],[2262,["So the conditionings of these matter as","we think it to be"]],[2267,["is to be absolutely taken out."]],[2270,["Of course, I mean in certain countries","we should say"]],[2273,["that the antique things [that] were made","were good and nice."]],[2276,["But, only because something is antique it","should not be respected,"]],[2279,["[but] because of its intrinsic value","of aesthetics, it’s alright."]],[2286,["But one has to see first of all","the vibrations of everything."]],[2291,["If the vibrations are good then you should","accept, otherwise not,"]],[2295,["because we have the language of vibrations"]],[2299,["and we have to use the language","of vibrations."]],[2304,["Once you start using the language","of vibrations you’ll be surprised"]],[2308,["how you will get the complete picture","as to what is to be done."]],[2319,["So to get rid of these three conditionings","too, for our body is very important."]],[2326,["And the worst thing for a Sahaja Yogi [is]","to think that he’s sick:"]],[2332,["is a, sort of a, tarnishing the name","of Sahaja Yoga."]],[2337,["If you still feel you are sick you better","get out of Sahaja Yoga!"]],[2343,["Because either you get well or you are not","a Sahaja Yogi, one of the two things."]],[2350,["If you are a Sahaja Yogi you have to see","that you get well"]],[2353,["and if there are certain problems also –","doesn’t matter."]],[2356,["Now, for example, supposing, I have certain","problems,"]],[2359,["which I know, because of Sahaja Yoga,"]],[2362,["because of My position as the Mother,","position as Adi Shakti:"]],[2368,["certain physical things I have to face,"]],[2370,["parasympathetic working I have to face,"]],[2373,["but I go through it! Is accepted."]],[2376,["You have to accept your body as it is","and you are not to sort of say that,"]],[2381,["“I’m not well,” and “There’s something","rong with me,”"]],[2383,["and go on complaining like some old hag!"]],[2387,["Never think you are old, first of all."]],[2390,["Never think that you have gone old or you","are no good."]],[2395,["Look at your Mother. I never think that","way."]],[2398,["Yesterday half of you were sleeping, still","I was alert"]],[2402,["and listening to the music and today I’m","again alert here."]],[2405,["So if you have a Guru then that image","should be with you that:"]],[2410,["“Look at our Mother. She’s so old, how much","She travels, how much She does!”"]],[2414,["Alright, you might say, She’s the Adi","Shakti!"]],[2416,["But little bit of shakti you too have."]],[2419,["And that shakti is to be shown by your","full dynamism."]],[2426,["If you have no dynamism and if you still","feel very weak"]],[2429,["that means you are not a Sahaja Yogi."]],[2431,["So just ask for, ask for any amount of","energy – it can come to you."]],[2437,["That dynamism, it should be there."]],[2439,["Now this I would say, for the physical","self that one has to know"]],[2443,["that you are all younger and getting","younger and younger,"]],[2446,["but not the stupidity of youth, but","gravity, the gravity of the age."]],[2453,["Actually I have seen children who are","born realised,"]],[2457,["they are very grave, they won’t do anything","that is not dignified."]],[2463,["And they will never, I’ve never heard them","talking to some of –"]],[2469,["the Sahaja Yoginis have a bad habit","of talking,"]],[2470,["“tuk, tuk, tuk, tuk, tuk, tuk,” among","themselves."]],[2472,["It’s a very bad habit. Which shows that","they [are] still very much lacking."]],[2478,["Just wearing saris or wearing bindis you do","not become a Sahaja Yogini."]],[2482,["First of all, what is the gravity?"]],[2483,["You should only speak whenever it is","necessary."]],[2486,["So I have seen these Sahaja Yogis who are","born realised children"]],[2491,["they stand like this before Me."]],[2493,["And they say very few words, but beautiful","words they speak."]],[2498,["And say things, which you can remember","all the time."]],[2502,["They just do not go on wasting anything."]],[2505,["And they are extremely obedient."]],[2507,["So from them one can learn that these are","born realised"]],[2511,["and the way their Guru principle is acting,","are we also acting the same way?"]],[2516,["Or we are doing something that is not good","for our ascent?"]],[2520,["So even after coming to Sahaja Yoga if you","do not try hard"]],[2524,["to introspect yourself, you have missed","the point"]],[2527,["that you compare yourself with your Guru –","all the time."]],[2530,["Now. Then everything has to be understood"]],[2535,["in the right perspective that we are Sahaja","Yogis."]],[2538,["Now for a Sahaja Yogi first and foremost","thing"]],[2540,["[is] that he has to have love. First. For","others, not for himself."]],[2547,["If you are all the time worried about","yourself,"]],[2549,["“My body is such, my this thing such, and","I have to do this and that,”"]],[2553,["then you don’t love others. But do you see","to the comfort of others?"]],[2557,["Do you feel the compassion of other","Sahaja Yogis?"]],[2560,["Do you feel, “What have I to bring for","them? What is missing in them?”"]],[2564,["Do you work it out? Do you go out of","the way to help them?"]],[2570,["First of all Sahaja Yogis. Now Sahaja","Yogis are different things."]],[2576,["I have seen many Sahaja Yogis will go and","take the side of the non-Sahaja Yogis"]],[2581,["and try to debase the Sahaja Yogis.","Is a very wrong thing."]],[2585,["You belong to this new race"]],[2588,["and the people who do not belong to this","new race and if they are attacking anybody:"]],[2592,["these are your hands, your feet, your head,","and if they attack it,"]],[2597,["it is duty bound that you help them instead","of helping the others."]],[2602,["Maybe something wrong with this person,","doesn’t matter."]],[2604,["You need not show all the fair play there."]],[2607,["In that place you should support a Sahaja","Yogi out and out."]],[2611,["Later on you may correct and you may","tell that person,"]],[2614,["“You should not have done like this,","it was wrong.”"]],[2617,["So this dignity and this understanding","comes only through silence."]],[2622,["But if you are chirping all the time,","talking “tuktuk, tuktuk, tuktuk, tuktuk,”"]],[2627,["it can never, never can make you a deeper","person."]],[2631,["You’ll be just flying in the air with","all that."]],[2634,["So for women now is best is to take","to mauna,"]],[2637,["is to keep quiet, just keep quiet."]],[2640,["They all the time want to talk."]],[2643,["This I’ve heard from all the leaders that","it’s a big problem with women."]],[2647,["They just go on talking stories, telling","stories."]],[2651,["But if you ask them to come and speak,","they will start shaking."]],[2657,["How many can give speeches? Women?"]],[2663,["If you understand that if you cannot give","a speech, you better not talk also."]],[2671,["You should be able to give a speech because","your Mother is a woman, She gives speeches."]],[2675,["Why can’t you give some speech? You cannot."]],[2677,["If I make you stand here, you’ll be","shaking, I know that."]],[2680,["But if it comes to murmuring souls, you","are there."]],[2684,["So that is one thing women have to be very","careful [about]."]],[2687,["And as today is the Guru puja I have","to tell you things,"]],[2690,["not as a Mother but as your Guru."]],[2693,["That, if you have to ascend the best thing","is for you to stop talking."]],[2698,["“Maunam sarvartha sadhanam.” ‘Maun’ means","to keep quiet."]],[2702,["It gives you all kinds of facilities, just","keep quiet."]],[2708,["If somebody’s talking too much, just keep","quiet."]],[2712,["If somebody’s trying to criticise, keep","quiet."]],[2714,["That’s your silence, that’s your right,"]],[2716,["that’s your domain that you can keep","silent."]],[2720,["Just watch that person."]],[2722,["If it comes then to answer, then you can","answer better."]],[2727,["But if somebody’s trying to attack, you","just keep silent."]],[2732,["But this silence has to be established"]],[2734,["and one should only establish by not","talking too much."]],[2738,["I have seen also when I am sitting here, I","have seen women talking among themselves,"]],[2743,["and this is very wrong. You must learn","the silence."]],[2747,["Like yesterday I saw so many ladies also","were walking out, walking in."]],[2751,["In the church will you do that? You won’t","do it."]],[2754,["In the church there is no Christ, there’s","a horrible priest sitting there"]],[2758,["but you cannot do it. You all keep quiet,","you sit there nicely."]],[2763,["I’ve never seen anybody walking out here","and there"]],[2766,["and doing all kinds of things, putting","the children in front like that,"]],[2769,["making them sleep. Never! Can you do that","in the church?"]],[2776,["What a discipline people observe in that","church, which is an artificial place."]],[2780,["And where you are now, that kind of","a silence has to be there"]],[2785,["and that kind of understanding, that depth,","that awe has to be there."]],[2789,["But because we have not yet developed","that Guru thing."]],[2792,["If you have developed it then immediately","it will work out."]],[2795,["You will see your gravity will show in your","behaviour."]],[2799,["So this is for our attention not to be","wasted."]],[2812,["To discuss somebody, to discuss about","others’ characters, we have no business."]],[2817,["Do we discuss the character of one hand","to another hand?"]],[2820,["To discuss about what has happened about","marriages, things like that."]],[2824,["Also marriage is just… in Sahaja Yoga it’s","not such an important thing."]],[2829,["Some people pay too much attention","to marriage, you see,"]],[2832,["and marriage becomes a headache. Also","then, “What about my marriage?”"]],[2835,["Then again ten minutes you see that person,","“What about my marriage?”"]],[2838,["Again after ten minutes, “What about","my marriage?”"]],[2840,["You want to run away. I mean, you see,"]],[2843,["it’s something becomes like a mania for","people, “What should we do?”"]],[2847,["And the whole thing is, all depends, and","the whole programming"]],[2850,["depends on how you are going to get","married."]],[2853,["So you have come to Sahaja Yoga, you","are sanyasis."]],[2860,["You are not married people in a way."]],[2864,["You are married only to Sahaja Yoga,"]],[2866,["that’s your husband, that’s your wife."]],[2868,["And the so-called husband and wife are","there."]],[2872,["But if they are not Sahaja Yogis then you","are unmarried, definitely."]],[2877,["So too much attention is paid in Sahaja","Yoga to marriages."]],[2880,["I have seen that before, marriage, before","Sahaja Yoga,"]],[2887,["marriage was a joke; every third day there","was a divorce"]],[2890,["and people would run away and do all kinds","of things."]],[2895,["Then when they got married after Sahaja","Yoga"]],[2899,["they are the greatest romantic people ever","known in the whole world!"]],[2903,["I mean, all ‘Romeo, Juliets’ going about.","I just don’t understand."]],[2906,["Even in the Indian villages people complain","that,"]],[2909,["“What sort of these people are? I mean,","they have no sense at all"]],[2912,["and the way they go round, are they","the saints?”"]],[2915,["So that saintliness, that sanyasta, that","asceticism"]],[2922,["has to be expressed in our married life."]],[2925,["I don’t mean that you don’t have","relationship with your husband"]],[2928,["but in a very private way. It’s has to be","extremely private"]],[2933,["and it should not be such a great thing","to go into romanticism."]],[2938,["You’ll ruin the whole of Sahaja Yoga in the","West if you start doing that nonsense!"]],[2942,["Because also there’s an idea about it that,","you see, you fall in love."]],[2948,["But then you’ll fall! That’s the first","point is."]],[2951,["You will fall [but] you want to rise."]],[2953,["So this attachment and this worry about","the husband and this and that,"]],[2958,["I mean, you can carry on with any kind of a","husband and wife if you are a Sahaja Yogi,"]],[2961,["should be able to. I mean, I know that’s","very simple."]],[2966,["It’s a… your husband is a study, wife is","a study, that’s all."]],[2969,["You study a person, what sort of a person","he is."]],[2971,["But for that you have to have the witness","state"]],[2974,["and you have to see, you have to be","detached."]],[2976,["So in marriages one has to be detached."]],[2980,["But, on the contrary, I find that just","after the marriage"]],[2984,["they want to organise some special thing","for them"]],[2987,["to go to some sort of a honeymoon or some","sort of a thing!"]],[2992,["I don’t know how these ideas crawl up."]],[2994,["These are coming from the old conditionings","of things"]],[2997,["and after honeymoon they come and say,"]],[2999,["“Mother, this marriage is not going","to work out.”"]],[3002,["So it’s better to do slow and steady and","then decide."]],[3006,["Because you just jump into honeymoon mood","and come back and say,"]],[3009,["“Mother, this, I have started thinking and","I don’t think.”"]],[3013,["I know of a lady who was jumping with","a Indian gentleman"]],[3018,["and she was on her way to Australia. In","Singapore, she telephones that,"]],[3022,["“Mother, I don’t think this marriage will","work out.”"]],[3024,["And here everybody complained to Me,","“Mother,"]],[3027,["these two are behaving in such a manner","that Indians are rather embarrassed.”"]],[3032,["So the sense of shame you must learn","from Indians."]],[3036,["They’d never… husband and wife never sit","together in India"]],[3040,["is regarded as bad manners and it should","be with you also."]],[3043,["That, even in the puja, even in anything","they are sitting in the public."]],[3048,["What is the need to show your relationship","in the public?"]],[3052,["It’s only in the private. This is one","of the things one,"]],[3056,["if you start understanding, there will be","a proper adjustment."]],[3060,["Men should be with men in the public,"]],[3063,["women should be with the women together."]],[3067,["But the women or men, whatever they are"]],[3070,["whatever are their bad, bad points should","not be brought back."]],[3077,["Like, I would say the men have jealousies","and they have power orientation"]],[3084,["and they discuss about leadership and they,","every, they get a shock"]],[3090,["if you tell them that you are not going","to be a leader,"]],[3092,["as if they think leadership is something","very concrete."]],[3095,["It’s the greatest myth ever going, is this","leadership!"]],[3099,["There’s nothing like leaders in this Sahaja","Yoga, it’s just a joke."]],[3105,["And your Mother is very good at playing","serious jokes."]],[3108,["So be careful! Don’t be childish about it."]],[3113,["You have to understand that this is a big","joke going on"]],[3116,["and it’s just a testing point and if I test","you wrong,"]],[3121,["you can tell Me, but I think this has","worked well,"]],[3124,["because I can test people very well on that","level"]],[3126,["and immediately I know when the person","gets onto the horse of ego."]],[3131,["So, for your mental attitude, has to be","different"]],[3136,["and our priorities have to change."]],[3140,["Our priorities have to change. What are","our priorities?"]],[3143,["First and foremost thing is our ascent, is","the first priority."]],[3148,["For our ascent whatever is needed has to be","done."]],[3151,["If you have to punish your body, alright."]],[3153,["If you have to punish yourself, alright."]],[3156,["If you have a conditioning, get rid of it.","Just introspect yourself,"]],[3163,["that is Self-realisation, is to know your","Self."]],[3166,["When you know your Self and know"]],[3167,["what is clinging onto it, just to remove it","completely."]],[3172,["Work it out the way you like. Work it out","the way you like."]],[3176,["You see, it is very important that","the body, mind,"]],[3187,["everything should be your slaves."]],[3191,["Nothing should dominate you. You should be","on top of everything."]],[3196,["How dare your body ask for anything?"]],[3199,["How dare your mind tells you anything?"]],[3202,["How this conditioning works on you?"]],[3204,["“I am a Sahaja Yogi, I’m above everything.”"]],[3207,["Like the lotuses have come out of the","ponds, you have come out of it."]],[3213,["We have so many proofs to show that you","are realised souls."]],[3219,["I’ll show you some photographs that I have","to show that there is light."]],[3223,["I can put light into you, they are all","enlightened people."]],[3226,["But in My presence if you become the light,"]],[3229,["you must carry the light outside."]],[3230,["Not only in My presence, but when you go","out."]],[3234,["But one of the reasons, I think, when I","tell something people just start thinking"]],[3238,["about whom Mother is talking, they never","think, “She is talking about me."]],[3243,["That’s the only way you can penetrate","within yourself"]],[3246,["when you see that, “Mother is talking","about me,"]],[3248,["She’s correcting me all alone and She’s","telling me.”"]],[3252,["Then only it will penetrate and it will","work out."]],[3256,["The priorities have to be changed and","the first and foremost"]],[3260,["is your ascent and the Spirit and Sahaja","Yoga."]],[3264,["The rest is negligible, nothing important."]],[3271,["Then the faith that there is this","All-pervading Power,"]],[3278,["which is looking after us, is very","important."]],[3282,["This time the musicians came all the way."]],[3284,["I must tell you the story of their travel."]],[3287,["They came and they said that there’s","a train from Kiev"]],[3291,["and they also bought the tickets so got","into the train"]],[3293,["and they were off-loaded before","the Hungarian border."]],[3299,["They didn’t know what to do, they had","no visas, nothing"]],[3302,["and not so much money also. They thought,","“We are on the train.”"]],[3305,["They said, “No, you have to go cross over"]],[3307,["and go to Budapest,” and they didn’t","know where,"]],[3309,["they were standing on the road. And,","but they were all laughing"]],[3314,["and enjoying, “must be something in store","for us.”"]],[3317,["Nobody felt that they were in trouble","or in anything."]],[3319,["So surrendered. “So, suddenly,” they said,"]],[3322,["“the custom people came and surrounded","them,” and they said,"]],[3325,["“What’s the matter, how are you here","with all these bags and baggage?”"]],[3329,["So they said, “Why are you here?” They","said, “We have come for a concert and this,"]],[3333,["and musicians we are and all.” And some","or other they started melting away."]],[3338,["And then they gave them Realisation!"]],[3340,["Six of them got Realisation. Now can you","believe: the power of love."]],[3344,["And the custom officers they offered their","own cars, took them down to the other side."]],[3350,["It’s never happened with custom officers!","Imagine!"]],[3353,["It would be like shaving their teeth off,","I tell you,"]],[3357,["the way if you can do that to the custom","officer! But it happened."]],[3363,["And they came to the other side and left","them there."]],[3366,["Now they didn’t know what to do. They","wanted to go to Budapest,"]],[3369,["they had to walk about two miles or","something to the station."]],[3373,["So they were waiting there well, they","said that, “Mother, You sent maybe,"]],[3378,["two Yugoslavs came in a big bus of 49","people – all vacant.”"]],[3384,["They stopped the bus and said, “What is it,","why are you here?”"]],[3387,["So they said, “This is our problem and we","have to go.”"]],[3389,["So they got into the bus. When he was","driving them down,"]],[3393,["they thought of talking to him that, “Why","not you take us to Milan?”"]],[3397,["And they managed!"]],[3401,["And they were in Milan. It’s so remarkable."]],[3405,["So to have faith completely in yourself"]],[3409,["and in that Power, which is surrounding","you."]],[3412,["And once you have that faith you will","realise that,"]],[3417,["that, though it is so helpful to you, it is","so kind to you,"]],[3421,["on the same level if you think it, it can","be very harmful."]],[3429,["So then never listen to the Guruninda,"]],[3434,["means anybody talks anything ill about","your Guru,"]],[3437,["just put your hands to your ears,","absolutely, immediately."]],[3442,["I have known of a person who did that","[and] got cancer,"]],[3445,["another now in jail, another one there."]],[3448,["So anybody is saying like that just put","your hands."]],[3451,["Because now you know that – what is your","Guru."]],[3455,["So you should never hear anything against","your Guru from anyone."]],[3461,["The other day one gentleman asked Me","a question, a newsman."]],[3465,["He said that, “I am told you have made","a castle for Yourself.”"]],[3469,["I said, “I have paid for it, I have made it","also."]],[3471,["It was a horrid place, no doubt. But there","are only Sahaja Yogis staying there,"]],[3474,["I am not staying there. That’s the best","part.” But that’s all I said."]],[3478,["But on the contrary, they never go and ask","these questions to any gurus on anything."]],[3484,["Because the disciples say, “Yes, so what?","We want to give"]],[3487,["to our guru money and this and that.”","They never ask."]],[3489,["But, through Sahaja Yoga, or [by] Myself,","have cured"]],[3493,["so many people of incurable diseases –","I could have minted money."]],[3497,["For curing one cancer patient I could have","made a castle, Myself."]],[3503,["So when people say like that you should","say,"]],[3505,["“Do you know how many people She has","cured? How much money She could have taken"]],[3509,["from them if She was a doctor or She was","a false guru?"]],[3514,["How much money She would have made","out of all of them?”"]],[3517,["Then they will understand. You see, because","they are being"]],[3520,["materialistic they talk like that. And","their attitude is very different"]],[3525,["and so, to tell them off is the best way."]],[3528,["Because I have seen that these press people","are absolutely harassed"]],[3534,["by the disciples of the false Gurus. Just","they cannot criticise,"]],[3539,["they cannot say a word against such","false Gurus."]],[3542,["While I find that Sahaja Yogis still lack"]],[3545,["that complete faith in themselves and","complete assertion."]],[3551,["Where you have to assert you must assert."]],[3555,["For example, anybody says something wrong","against Me, you have to assert;"]],[3560,["must say, “No, not possible. It’s not!” But","I have seen some people"]],[3564,["asking Me funny questions who are ‘Sahaja","Yogis’ also!"]],[3568,["So the first part is that to see how much","we are sensitive to spirituality."]],[3576,["I have seen Sahaja Yogis supporting","somebody who is so negative,"]],[3580,["you can’t even bear that person and, [to","them], such a person is something great,"]],[3586,["while somebody who is so good they cannot","make it out."]],[3589,["So what’s the use? Your computer is so","faulty, you’ll do…"]],[3593,["I mean, the planes will have to run up","and down"]],[3595,["if you have such a computer as Sahaja","Yogis are!"]],[3598,["Because they just judge the other way","round."]],[3601,["A person who is good in Sahaja Yoga, who","has got vibrations,"]],[3605,["he may be simple, he may be unassuming,"]],[3607,["he may not be so rich, he may not be","so educated,"]],[3610,["may not be from some good universities","or anything,"]],[3613,["but you must see the vibrations of that","person!"]],[3616,["What sort of vibrations that person has,","and then you should judge."]],[3620,["Instead of that if you judge that person","only because he’s very good to talk"]],[3626,["and he talks well and very scholarly or","something like that, that’s not the point."]],[3630,["The point is what are his vibrations! And","once you see those vibrations"]],[3634,["and judge them on vibrations, then you are","a Sahaja Yogi,"]],[3638,["otherwise I would not call you at all","a Sahaja Yogi."]],[3640,["But for a Guru it is very important.","I have seen sometimes"]],[3644,["even the leaders supporting somebody","who is absolutely horrid!"]],[3648,["I can’t bear that person even for five","minutes!"]],[3651,["But here the guru sends him over to Me,"]],[3654,["“Oh, Mother, he’s so good, you know, he","donated so much money.”"]],[3659,["It doesn’t matter. You donated money,","so what?"]],[3662,["Who asked him to donate money?"]],[3664,["But he should not donate his bhoots to us","now anymore!"]],[3667,["We don’t want his bhoot! So that’s what","it is."]],[3670,["So the judgment should be correct about","a person"]],[3673,["when you say that this man is not good","or that is not good."]],[3677,["But mostly ‘gurus’ themselves are caught up"]],[3679,["and then they are ambitious and if somebody","doesn’t listen to them"]],[3684,["or somebody wants to give a lecture","at a wrong time and somebody says,"]],[3688,["“You shouldn’t talk like this,” or","something, then they get angry."]],[3691,["They are very hot tempered and they provoke","people, they say things sometimes."]],[3696,["And then when people react they say,","“You are a bad Sahaja Yogi.”"]],[3699,["That’s not the way. First of all a guru","or a leader"]],[3703,["has to be himself a very mild, gentle, and","a good person."]],[3709,["He has to be in such a way [that] he should","not demand anything,"]],[3712,["should not ask for anything. Never demand","anything!"]],[3716,["Anybody who demands cannot be a guru."]],[3721,["Respect is to be commanded and not","to be demanded."]],[3724,["And so, everything works out well if you","understand that –"]],[3731,["once you rise in your ascent, in your","wisdom,"]],[3735,["in your awareness and in your Spirit –","automatically all these things happen!"]],[3740,["You don’t have to ask for anything, you","don’t have to plead for anything,"]],[3743,["you don’t have to complain for anything,","everything works out."]],[3746,["You are looked after by all the ganas,","by all the angels."]],[3751,["They are there. You are on the stage."]],[3753,["But if you are halfway then they play","tricks with you."]],[3756,["You see, they play tricks, they make you","falter, you have problems,"]],[3760,["you go here, you go there, all these","things happen"]],[3763,["and then you say, “Mother, how is it","this happened?”"]],[3766,["Because they are also jokers, so they play","jokes with you"]],[3770,["and they make problems for you just to make","you understand that you are doing wrong."]],[3775,["So we are on a stage where there’s","a beautiful security,"]],[3779,["everything is there and we have to give","to the world"]],[3784,["such a great thing like Sahaja Yoga,"]],[3786,["which is for the emancipation of the whole","world, as you realise,"]],[3789,["and so also I hope you realise your","responsibilities."]],[3793,["There are so many things one has to","understand, how one has to be as a guru,"]],[3798,["how he has to act and how he has to work","out."]],[3801,["Now I have given so many lectures","on Guru things,"]],[3804,["but, for today’s lecture, only I have","to say"]],[3807,["that, first thing, to have a guru system,"]],[3813,["you must have complete humility."]],[3816,["Now, with Me, I would say, I am too simple"]],[3821,["and I am Mahamaya, so you be very careful."]],[3825,["You cannot take liberties with Me. You","cannot take."]],[3829,["If you try to take too much liberties that","means you are not a disciple."]],[3834,["A disciple has to keep a distance from","the Guru."]],[3838,["You cannot just take liberties, walk into","My room every time,"]],[3841,["sit there for hours together, chit-chat","with Me – nothing!"]],[3845,["You have no right."]],[3846,["Only when I call you, when I ask for you,","you should come."]],[3852,["Then you should not force things on","the Guru that,"]],[3855,["“Please, come and listen to this,” or,","“Do this!” that should not be said."]],[3860,["For example, yesterday nobody told Me there","are going to be"]],[3863,["these music programs or everything","arranged."]],[3866,["So you have to report everything to your","leader, or to Me,"]],[3871,["all those things that you want to do.","And it should be really transparent."]],[3874,["Like this hand knows everything that this","hand is doing,"]],[3877,["and this hand knows everything that this","hand is doing."]],[3879,["In the same way everybody should know","each other."]],[3883,["Then the gurus should not have jealousies","for each other."]],[3888,["This I’m just telling you because also","I found out"]],[3892,["that there are certain jealousies. And when","they talk there is a little bit of,"]],[3897,["“Ha, he’s good, but this, this, this.”"]],[3900,["When they enjoy each other’s company"]],[3903,["because they have reached a certain state"]],[3906,["and they understand, “This is the state","we are in.”"]],[3908,["When they enjoy each other’s company fully","and appreciate each other"]],[3912,["much more than anybody else – the guru’s","company."]],[3918,["All the company of the leaders, if they","enjoy each other"]],[3925,["and there’s no jealousy, there’s no fight,","there’s no problem"]],[3929,["but just the enjoyment of the company,"]],[3931,["then they should know that they have","become a guru."]],[3934,["Now all of them never fought with each","other. They supported."]],[3937,["Actually it is one Principle was born again","and again."]],[3940,["But only the satanic people – they’ll fight","among themselves, not the godly."]],[3946,["And also they will talk against the person","who is a realised soul"]],[3952,["or who is an Incarnation, but never","against themselves."]],[3955,["It’s very surprising that the satanic","people,"]],[3959,["though they fight among themselves, there","are jealousies,"]],[3961,["they’ll never talk of each other."]],[3964,["But here I find that in Sahaja Yoga we","have freedom."]],[3968,["But freedom is not abandonment,","is the freedom"]],[3970,["with complete rules and regulations","of the Divine, with us,"]],[3974,["and we have to know them that this is","the Divine Law."]],[3978,["So all of us are now sitting like in a big","vimana, like an aeroplane,"]],[3984,["and we all have to land into the beautiful","area."]],[3988,["But first of all we have to develop that","humility in your heart;"]],[3994,["complete humility and surrender, that’s","very important."]],[3998,["Unless and until you have that humility","and surrender in your heart,"]],[4002,["Guru principle cannot be awakened."]],[4005,["First you have to be the disciple and then","the guru."]],[4009,["So you have to develop that humility."]],[4011,["And that humility comes very easily if","you love Me, respect Me."]],[4018,["It’s not only love, but respect."]],[4023,["That respect has to be there and then","people will respect you."]],[4029,["May God bless you."]]]);
